      "content": "but i just don't want to be that person who goes to the er for nothing. my friend had surgery and she said the pain was intense for like a week. if i just take some more tylenol and maybe some warm compresses on my stomach, it should help with the inflammation, right? surely it isn't an \"emergency\" if i can still walk around and talk to you? i'll just sleep it off and see how i feel in the morning.",
